+# Corpus fetching
+
+The corpus fetch had to respect Svipall's per-domain limit of **12 visits per
+60-second window**. Breaching that limit triggered a **900-second (15-minute)
+cooldown** for the affected domain.
+
+Files were fetched through these origin/CDN mirror hosts:
+
+- `raw.githubusercontent.com`
+- `cdn.jsdelivr.net`, using paths of the form
+  `https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/owner/repo@branch/path`
+- `cdn.statically.io` (this mirror was slow and sometimes timed out)
